    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d580-a1">

                <pb facs="0540" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg466"/>

                <head>Mr. Perry to Mr.
                        Adams</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 9, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir:</hi> I hasten to enclose for your use a
                    copy of a letter received half an hour since from our consul at Teneriffe, in
                    hope it may precede the arrival of the Calabar at Liverpool. I also send a copy
                    to Mr. Seward.</p>
                <p>Very truly, &amp;c, &amp;c, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HORATIO J. PERRY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles</hi> F. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Adams, &amp;c.,&amp;c.,London.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
